Peptide OmniPanel — Third-Party Notices & Research Scope Statement
==================================================================

1. Scientific & Regulatory Scope Disclaimer
-------------------------------------------
Peptide OmniPanel is an academic research platform intended strictly for
early-stage preclinical hypothesis generation and compound prioritization
(`internal_research_only`). Predictions, uncertainty intervals, structural
saliency maps, and linked regulatory label records MUST NOT be used for
clinical diagnosis, patient dosing, medical decision-making, or regulatory
submissions.

2. US Federal Government Public-Domain Regulatory PK Records
------------------------------------------------------------
Regulatory pharmacokinetic reference values displayed in the Clinical &
Regulatory PK panel (`web/clinical_evidence_index.json`) are restricted
exclusively to factual observations extracted from US Federal Government
public-domain sources — specifically FDA DailyMed Structured Product
Labeling (SPL) XML documents (`https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/`) and US FDA
Drugs@FDA NDA/BLA Clinical Pharmacology Reviews (`https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/`),
which are public domain under 17 U.S.C. § 105.

